 "summary": "Seven 2 A rectifier diodes with glass passivated junctions in the SMA (DO-214AC) surface mount package. They differ only in reverse voltage rating, from 50 V (S2A) to 1000 V (S2M). Forward drop is at most 1.0 V at 2 A, leakage at most 2 µA at rated DC voltage and 25 °C, and a single 8.3 ms half-sine surge of 50 A is allowed. S2M is the 1000 V type.",
